#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJECTS WITH LOW AMPLITUDE TREMOR:
# REST TREMOR, CONDITION: DBS OFF, MEDICATION ON (n=8 files)
#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ   FILE       RANGE VELOCITY LASER  RATE SAMPLES
# g9     g9ron.rit  0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  9156
# g10    g10ron.let 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  12108
# g11    g11ron.let 0.1   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6366
# g12    g12ron.rit 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  7176
# g13    g13ron.rit 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6234
# s14    s14ron.rit 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6228
# s15    s15ron.rit 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6102
# s16    s16ron.let 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6696
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ:  g = GPi = Globus Pallidus interna
#        v = Vim = Ventro-intermediate nucleus of the thalamus
#        s = STN = subthalamic nucleus
# RANGE:    Range (V)  Precision (+/- mm/s)
#               2.0        1.0 
#               1.0        0.5
#               0.5        0.25
#               0.2        0.1
#               0.1        0.05
# VELOCITY: units of velocity in recordings 
#           (mm/s or m/s)
# LASER: laser speed setting 
#        (0-0.2 m/s or 0-1 m/s)
# RATE: sampling rate in Hz
# 
# SAMPLES: number of samples in recording
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
